msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_CleaningDay_Act4_2_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "별로 안 깨끗한데…?"
msgstr "Nie tak czysto"

msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_ElderTry_Act1_1_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "모든 병에 무적이라 보시면 되세요 어르신~"
msgstr "Można powiedzieć, że leczy wszystko!"

msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_ElderTry_Act2_1_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "네, 같이 드시면 효과가 더 좋으세요 어르신~"
msgstr "Tak, jeszcze lepiej, gdy są razem!"

msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_ElderTry_Act3_1_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "드시면 바로 나타나세요 어르신~"
